  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>The UX writing career path India runs through an existing skill, not a fresh-graduate application:</strong>
    most people who break in are already content writers, copywriters, or UI/UX designers who add the missing
    half — product thinking for writers, writing craft for designers — and prove it with a self-built portfolio,
